  "details": "Have the 5-10 most recent photos taken kept in a cache, whether they were taken in print mode or not, so that they can easily be printed if the user forgets to switch the camera to print mode first or didn't originally intend to print it. The cache gets reset when leaving the game. The current workaround for this is to upload the photo to the VRchat website and add it to your gallery to print, which is cumbersome and lacks the world metadata.",
